            <div style="padding: 0.75rem;">
              <strong style="color: #003853; display: block; font-size: 0.95rem;">Sansibar-Nelken (Karafuu)</strong>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b;">Duftende Blütenknospen, die an hohen Nelkenbäumen von grün zu karmesinrot wechseln.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
            <img src="{{ 'zanzibar-spice-farm-tour-fresh-nutmeg-cloves.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'zanzibar-spice-farm-tour-fresh-nutmeg-cloves.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <div style="padding: 0.75rem;">
              <strong style="color: #003853; display: block; font-size: 0.95rem;">Frische Muskatnuss & Macis</strong>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b;">Aufgeschnitten, um den leuchtend roten, spitzenartigen Arillus (Macis) zu enthüllen, der den inneren Muskatnusssamen umhüllt.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
            <img src="{{ 'zanzibar-cinnamon-bark-tree-harvest.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'zanzibar-cinnamon-bark-tree-harvest.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <div style="padding: 0.75rem;">
              <strong style="color: #003853; display: block; font-size: 0.95rem;">Zimtrinde-Abschälen</strong>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #64748b;">Rinde wird vom Baumstamm geschabt, die sich natürlich zu süß duftenden Quillen kräuselt.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8ed;">
